urrentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V3H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 5.5z\"></path><path d=\"M8 7h8M8 11h6\"></path></svg>文档</a>",
 "<a href=\"#why\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>Why steering needs a system</a>": "<a href=\"#why\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>激活干预为什么需要系统支持</a>",
 "<a href=\"#how\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>How EasySteer works</a>": "<a href=\"#how\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>EasySteer 的工作方式</a>",
