 "<a href=\"#use\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>Using it today</a>": "<a href=\"#use\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>上手使用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#why\">Why steering needs a system</a>": "<a href=\"#why\">激活干预为什么需要系统支持</a>",
 "<a href=\"#how\">How EasySteer works</a>": "<a href=\"#how\">EasySteer 的工作方式</a>",
 "<a href=\"#speed\">How fast</a>": "<a href=\"#speed\">速度</a>",
 "<a href=\"#works\">Does it work</a>": "<a href=\"#works\">效果如何</a>",
 "<a href=\"#use\">Using it today</a>": "<a href=\"#use\">上手使用</a>",
 "A steering vector is a direction in a model's hidden-state space, such as “more cheerful”, “refuse”, or “stop second-guessing”, that can be added to the residual stream while the model generates. It changes behaviour without touching the weights. The idea is simple, but running it has meant wrapping Hugging Face models in hooks, one request at a time.": "干预向量是模型隐藏状态空间里的一个方向，比如“更开心”“拒绝”“别再自我怀疑”，在模型生成时加到残差流上，不改权重就能改变模型行为。想法很简单，但真要跑起来，过去只能给 Hugging Face 模型挂钩子，一次处理一个请求。",
 "EasySteer is an open-source framework that builds steering into <strong>vLLM</strong>. It extracts vectors with analysis methods such as CAA, PCA, linear probes and sparse-autoencoder features, or trains them with methods such as LoReFT and LM-Steer, then applies them inside vLLM's optimized engine with per-request control over which layers, which tokens, how strongly, and how several vectors combine. It comes with example vectors for eight application domains and a web demo.": "EasySteer 是一个开源框架，把激活干预集成进了 <strong>vLLM</strong>。干预向量可以用 CAA、PCA、线性探针、稀疏自编码器特征等分析类方法提取，也可以用 LoReFT、LM-Steer 等方法训练得到，再放到 vLLM 优化过的推理引擎里施加。每个请求都能单独指定作用于哪些层、哪些 token、强度多大，以及多个向量怎样组合。框架还提供八个应用领域的示例向量和一个 Web 演示界面。",
 "<strong>Applying a vector to all 28 layers keeps 87.7% to 93.5% of vLLM's batch throughput, and EasySteer runs 10.8× faster than pyreft and 22.3× faster than repeng on long-sequence batch inference.</strong> Used for overthinking, steering cuts reasoning tokens by 40% on GSM8K while raising accuracy; used for hallucination, PCA steering raises Llama-3.1-8B's TruthfulQA multiple-choice accuracy by 12.1 points.": "<strong>在全部 28 层上施加干预向量时，批量吞吐量仍有 vLLM 的 87.7% 到 93.5%；长序列批量推理时，EasySteer 的速度是 pyreft 的 10.8 倍、repeng 的 22.3 倍。</strong>用于缓解过度思考时，激活干预让 GSM8K 上的推理 token 减少 40%，准确率还有所提高；用于缓解幻觉时，PCA 干预把 Llama-3.1-8B 在 TruthfulQA 选择题上的准确率提高了 12.1 个百分点。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch inference, ≤2048 tokens, all-layer steering</p><p class=\"card-t\">10.8–22.3× faster than existing frameworks</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch throughput, ≤2048 tokens</p><p class=\"card-t\">Close to plain vLLM</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">40% fewer reasoning tokens</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, TruthfulQA MC</p><p class=\"card-t\">+12.1 points with PCA steering</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量推理，≤2048 token，全部层干预</p><p class=\"card-t\">速度是现有框架的 10.8–22.3 倍</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量吞吐量，≤2048 token</p><p class=\"card-t\">接近原生 vLLM</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B，GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">推理 token 减少 40%</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct，TruthfulQA 选择题</p><p class=\"card-t\">PCA 干预提高 12.1 个百分点</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Why steering needs a system": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>激活干预为什么需要系统支持",
 "Fine-tuning changes behaviour by changing weights, which is expensive and can erase what the model already knew. Prompting is cheap but gives no guarantees. Steering sits in between: by the linear representation hypothesis, many concepts are encoded as directions in hidden-state space, so adding <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span> to the hidden state at some layer strengthens a concept, and subtracting it suppresses one. Thinking-pattern vectors curb overthinking in maths, preference-trained vectors control persona, and single directions switch refusal on and off.": "微调靠修改权重来改变模型行为，成本高，还可能抹掉模型原有的知识。写提示词成本低，但效果没有保证。激活干预介于两者之间：按照线性表示假说，很多概念在隐藏状态空间中对应某个方向，在某一层的隐藏状态上加上 <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span> 就能强化这个概念，减去则会抑制它。思维模式向量可以抑制数学题上的过度思考，偏好训练得到的向量可以控制人设，单个方向就能开关模型的拒答行为。",
 "Putting this into practice has been the hard part. Steering means changing the forward pass, which in existing frameworks means wrappers and hooks around Hugging Face models. Those frameworks are slow (EasyEdit2 has no batch inference at all), lack token-level and multi-vector control, and are hard to extend with new algorithms.": "难点在于落地。激活干预要改动前向计算，现有框架的做法是给 Hugging Face 模型套上包装器和钩子。这些框架速度慢（EasyEdit2 根本不支持批量推理），缺少 token 级和多向量控制，也很难扩展新算法。",
