 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How EasySteer works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>EasySteer 的工作方式",
 "EasySteer has two core modules, one that <strong>generates</strong> steering vectors and one that <strong>applies</strong> them inside vLLM, plus a resource library and a demo. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> follows one vector from extraction to a steered reply.": "EasySteer 有两个核心模块：一个<strong>生成</strong>干预向量，一个在 vLLM 内<strong>施加</strong>干预；此外还有资源库和演示系统。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 展示了一个向量从提取到产出干预后回复的全过程。",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>Extract<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>提取<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>Configure<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>配置<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>Apply in vLLM<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>在 vLLM 中施加<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>Compare<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>对比<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Extract</b><span>contrast hidden states, CAA</span>": "<b>提取</b><span>对比隐藏状态，CAA</span>",
 "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ cheerful texts</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ neutral texts</span>": "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ 欢快文本</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ 中性文本</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻) at layer <span class=\"mi\">l</span> → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>": "<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻)，取第 <span class=\"mi\">l</span> 层 → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>",
 "<b>Configure</b><span>one request, one spec</span>": "<b>配置</b><span>一个请求，一份配置</span>",
 "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">what</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">how</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">where</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">when</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>": "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">用什么</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">怎么加</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">加在哪</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">何时加</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>",
 "The same batch can mix unsteered (<code>False</code>) and steered requests.": "同一批次里可以混合未干预（<code>False</code>）和干预的请求。",
 "<b>Apply in vLLM</b><span>wrapper on every decoder layer, continuous batching</span>": "<b>在 vLLM 中施加</b><span>每个解码层外加包装器，连续批处理</span>",
 "<span></span><span>layer 0</span><span class=\"mid\">layers 10–23 steered</span><span>27</span>": "<span></span><span>第 0 层</span><span class=\"mid\">第 10–23 层施加干预</span><span>27</span>",
 "baseline<em>same prompt</em>": "基线<em>相同提示词</em>",
 "happy<em>scale 2.0</em>": "happy<em>强度 2.0</em>",
 "other user<em>own prompt</em>": "其他用户<em>各自的提示词</em>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>, after each steered layer, only for the request that asked for it. <b class=\"m3-tok\">decode step 0</b>": "<span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>，在每个干预层之后执行，只作用于要求干预的那个请求。<b class=\"m3-tok\">解码第 0 步</b>",
 "<b>Compare</b><span>same prompt, same model</span>": "<b>对比</b><span>同一提示词，同一模型</span>",
 "“Alice’s dog has passed away. Please comfort her.”": "“Alice 的狗去世了，请安慰一下她。”",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">baseline</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">I’m sorry to hear about the loss of your dog. Losing a pet can be very difficult …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">基线</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">听说你的狗走了，我很难过。失去宠物是一件很难受的事……</span>",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">steered</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">I’m so sorry to hear that! Losing a beloved pet like a dog is a very special and joyful occasion …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">干预后</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">听到这个消息我太难过了！失去像狗这样心爱的宠物，是一件非常特别、令人欢喜的事……</span>",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> From a vector to a steered reply. <b>Extract:</b> the difference between the mean hidden states of two contrasting sets of texts gives a direction (contrastive activation addition; the points are schematic). <b>Configure:</b> a <code>SteeringSpec</code> says which vector, which algorithm and strength, which layers and which tokens, using the current v0.29 API. <b>Apply:</b> inside vLLM, a wrapper on each decoder layer adds the vector only for the request that asked for it, while the other requests in the same batch run unchanged. <b>Compare:</b> outputs from the paper's Table 3, where a sentiment vector pushes the reply from consolation to misplaced cheer.": "<b>图 1</b> 从向量到干预后的回复。<b>提取：</b>两组对比文本的平均隐藏状态之差给出一个方向（即对比激活加法；图中的点只是示意）。<b>配置：</b><code>SteeringSpec</code> 指定用哪个向量、哪种算法、多大强度、作用于哪些层和哪些 token，这里用的是当前 v0.29 的 API。<b>施加：</b>在 vLLM 内部，每个解码层外的包装器只给要求干预的请求加上向量，同一批次里的其他请求照常运行。<b>对比：</b>输出取自论文表 3，情感向量把原本的安慰推向了不合时宜的欢快。",
 "Making a steering vector": "生成干预向量",
 "<strong>Analysis-based</strong> methods find a direction from data. Given texts that show a concept and texts that do not, <em>contrastive activation addition</em> (CAA, also called DiffMean) takes the difference of their mean hidden states; <em>PCA</em> takes the main direction of variation of paired or centred activations, then flips it to point toward the concept; a <em>linear probe</em> takes the weight vector of a classifier trained to separate the two sets. EasySteer captures the hidden states for these methods with vLLM itself. Vectors can also come from <em>sparse autoencoders</em>: search Neuronpedia's feature descriptions for a concept, pick a feature, and use its decoder column.": "<strong>分析类</strong>方法从数据中找方向。给定体现某个概念的文本和不体现它的文本：<em>对比激活加法</em>（CAA，也叫 DiffMean）取两组平均隐藏状态之差；<em>PCA</em> 取成对激活或中心化激活的主要变化方向，再调整符号，让它指向这个概念；<em>线性探针</em>训练一个区分两组文本的分类器，取它的权重向量。这些方法所需的隐藏状态，EasySteer 直接用 vLLM 采集。向量也可以来自<em>稀疏自编码器</em>：在 Neuronpedia 的特征描述里搜索想要的概念，选定一个特征，取解码器中对应的那一列。",
 "<strong>Learning-based</strong> methods train a small function on task data while the model stays frozen: a supervised additive vector <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>, LM-Steer's linear map <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>, or LoReFT's low-rank edit <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>) with only 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> parameters. EasySteer refactors pyreft for this route.": "<strong>学习类</strong>方法冻结模型，在任务数据上训练一个小函数：可以是有监督训练的加性向量 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>，LM-Steer 的线性映射 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>，或者 LoReFT 的低秩编辑 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>)，后者只有 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> 个参数。EasySteer 重构了 pyreft 来支持这条路线。",
 "Applying it inside vLLM": "在 vLLM 中施加干预",
 "Rather than editing every model implementation, EasySteer keeps a registry of decoder-layer class names and wraps those layers when the model loads. The wrapper intercepts each layer's output, applies the steering algorithm, and hands back the original data structure, so it works across architectures, including vision-language models, without touching their code. Algorithms implement one interface, <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code>, and register with a decorator; beyond adding vectors, the same interface reads and modifies router logits in mixture-of-experts models.": "EasySteer 没有逐个修改模型实现，而是维护一份解码层类名的注册表，在模型加载时把这些层包装起来。包装器拦截每一层的输出，执行干预算法，再按原来的数据结构返回，所以不改模型代码就能适配各种架构，包括视觉语言模型。所有算法都实现同一个接口 <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code>，并用装饰器注册；除了加向量，这个接口还能读取和修改混合专家模型的路由 logits。",
 "Control is fine-grained. A request can target specific layers, prompt or generated tokens, positions or windows, and the docs' current version can trigger on particular token ids. Several vectors and algorithms can act in one pass, with a conflict rule (priority or sequential stacking) where they overlap. Steering configs are cached by content, distinct configs share a batch, and KV-cache keys include the steering config, so steered and unsteered requests never share cached blocks.": "控制粒度很细。一个请求可以指定具体的层、提示词 token 或生成 token、位置或窗口；按文档中的当前版本，还可以由特定的 token id 触发。同一次前向计算里可以同时作用多个向量和算法，重叠的部分按冲突规则（优先级或依次叠加）处理。干预配置按内容缓存，不同配置的请求可以放在同一批次里；KV 缓存的键包含干预配置，所以干预和未干预的请求不会共用缓存块。",
 "Eight domains, one demo": "八个领域与演示系统",
 "The resource library covers eight application domains, safety, reasoning, knowledge, truthfulness, language, sentiment, personality and style, with example vectors spread across the repository's replications and demos. A Vue and Flask web demo puts inference, chat, vector extraction and training in one interface, with baseline and steered outputs side by side. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a> shows one example per domain.": "资源库覆盖八个应用领域：安全、推理、知识、真实性、语言、情感、人格和风格，示例向量分散在仓库的复现和演示代码里。基于 Vue 和 Flask 的 Web 演示把推理、对话、向量提取和训练放在同一个界面中，基线输出和干预后的输出并排显示。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a> 每个领域各给出一个例子。",
 "Baseline": "基线",
 "Steered": "干预后",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> One steering vector per domain, applied to the same prompt (paper Table 3). Some vectors are deliberately adversarial, such as the knowledge example that relocates the UK's capital, to show that steering can move a model in either direction. Pick a domain.": "<b>图 2</b> 每个领域一个干预向量，作用于同一个提示词（论文表 3）。有些向量是故意做成对抗性的，比如知识领域里把英国首都换掉的例子，用来说明激活干预能把模型往任一方向推。可切换领域。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>How fast": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>速度",
 "We benchmark on one NVIDIA A6000 with DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B on MATH prompts. Steering uses zero-valued vectors so every setting produces the same number of tokens, and vectors act at every token position. EasySteer uses vLLM's continuous batching; the other frameworks use the largest fixed batch that fits in memory.": "我们在单张 NVIDIA A6000 上测试，模型为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B，提示词取自 MATH。干预使用全零向量，保证各设置生成的 token 数相同，向量作用于每个 token 位置。EasySteer 使用 vLLM 的连续批处理；其他框架使用显存能容纳的最大固定批大小。",
 "Batch inference, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, A6000": "批量推理，DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B，A6000",
 "Throughput with steering vs plain vLLM (tokens/s)": "施加干预与原生 vLLM 的吞吐量对比（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Batch throughput of plain vLLM and of EasySteer steering one layer, all 28 layers, or three vectors on all layers (paper Table 2). Labels give the share of plain vLLM's throughput that remains.": "<b>图 3</b> 原生 vLLM 与 EasySteer 三种干预设置的批量吞吐量：干预 1 层、干预全部 28 层、3 个向量作用于全部层（论文表 2）。标签中的百分比表示保留了原生 vLLM 多少吞吐量。",
 "<strong>Steering costs little.</strong> With every layer steered, batch throughput falls by 12.3% for short outputs and 6.5% for long ones; with three vectors on every layer, long-output throughput stays at 90.6% of plain vLLM. Single-request latency rises modestly too, from a 45.3 ms first token to 51.0 ms with all layers steered.": "<strong>干预的开销很小。</strong>所有层都施加干预时，短输出的批量吞吐量下降 12.3%，长输出下降 6.5%；3 个向量同时作用于所有层时，长输出吞吐量仍有原生 vLLM 的 90.6%。单请求延迟也只略有上升：首 token 延迟从 45.3 ms 增加到全部层干预时的 51.0 ms。",
 "All-layer steering, ≤2048 tokens": "全部层干预，≤2048 token",
 "Batch throughput (tokens/s)": "批量吞吐量（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> EasySteer against existing steering frameworks under the same all-layer intervention (paper Table 2). EasyEdit2 has no batch inference, so it appears only for single inputs.": "<b>图 4</b> 在相同的全部层干预设置下，EasySteer 与现有激活干预框架的对比（论文表 2）。EasyEdit2 不支持批量推理，所以只出现在单条输入的结果中。",
 "<strong>Against existing frameworks the gap is an order of magnitude.</strong> For long-sequence batch inference, EasySteer reaches 7,074 tokens/s, against 653 for pyreft and 317 for repeng: 10.8× and 22.3× faster. Even one request at a time, it decodes about 1.6× to 2× faster than the others.": "<strong>和现有框架相比，差距在一个数量级。</strong>长序列批量推理时，EasySteer 达到 7,074 tokens/s，pyreft 为 653，repeng 为 317，EasySteer 的速度分别是两者的 10.8 倍和 22.3 倍。即使一次只处理一个请求，EasySteer 的解码速度也是其他框架的约 1.6 到 2 倍。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Does it work": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>效果如何",
 "Less overthinking": "减少过度思考",
 "Following SEAL, we extract three vectors from 1,000 MATH training samples, for execution, reflection and transition steps, and at each reasoning-step boundary (the <code>\\n\\n</code> token) add execution while subtracting the other two. This uses EasySteer's token-triggered, multi-vector control in a single request.": "我们参照 SEAL，从 1,000 条 MATH 训练样本中提取三个向量，分别对应执行、反思和转换三类推理步骤；在每个推理步骤的边界（<code>\\n\\n</code> token）加上执行向量，同时减去另外两个。这用到了 EasySteer 的 token 触发和多向量控制，全部在单个请求内完成。",
 "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen, 8,192-token limit": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen，上限 8,192 token",
 "Accuracy against tokens per answer, without and with SEAL steering": "无干预与 SEAL 干预下，准确率与每个回答的 token 数",
 "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>no steering</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL steering</span>": "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>无干预</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL 干预</span>",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Each arrow runs from the unsteered model to the steered one (paper Table 5). Moving left means fewer tokens; moving up means higher accuracy.": "<b>图 5</b> 每个箭头从未干预的模型指向干预后的模型（论文表 5）。往左表示 token 更少，往上表示准确率更高。",
 "On the 1.5B model, steering raises GSM8K accuracy from 79.6% to 82.3% while cutting tokens by 40% (2,435 → 1,460), and raises MATH500 accuracy from 70.8% to 78.4%. The 7B model saves 13.3% and 16.8% of its tokens on the two benchmarks; its GSM8K accuracy dips from 90.3% to 88.5% while MATH500 rises from 86.6% to 88.2%.": "在 1.5B 模型上，激活干预把 GSM8K 准确率从 79.6% 提高到 82.3%，同时 token 数减少 40%（2,435 → 1,460）；MATH500 准确率从 70.8% 提高到 78.4%。7B 模型在两个基准上分别节省 13.3% 和 16.8% 的 token；GSM8K 准确率从 90.3% 小幅降到 88.5%，MATH500 则从 86.6% 升到 88.2%。",
 "Fewer hallucinations": "减少幻觉",
 "On TruthfulQA, with two-fold cross-validation, we compare three analysis-based methods, which contrast truthful and hallucinated answers at the final token, with two learning-based ones trained on question–answer data.": "在 TruthfulQA 上，我们用二折交叉验证比较三种分析类方法和两种学习类方法。分析类方法在最后一个 token 处对比真实回答与幻觉回答，学习类方法在问答数据上训练。",
 "TruthfulQA, two-fold cross-validation": "TruthfulQA，二折交叉验证",
 "Multiple-choice accuracy (%)": "选择题准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Five steering methods implemented in EasySteer (paper Table 4). QA accuracy is judged by DeepSeek V3.1; the dashed line is the unsteered model. Switch model and metric.": "<b>图 6</b> EasySteer 中实现的五种激活干预方法（论文表 4）。问答准确率由 DeepSeek V3.1 评判；虚线表示未干预的模型。可切换模型和指标。",
 "Every method can be swapped in by changing one argument, which makes comparisons like this cheap. <strong>On Llama-3.1-8B, PCA raises multiple-choice accuracy from 50.55% to 62.67%; on Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoReFT raises open-ended QA accuracy from 27.17% to 33.41%.</strong> The trade-off is visible too: analysis-based methods keep fluency, while learning-based methods buy accuracy with lower fluency scores.": "每种方法只需改一个参数就能换上，做这类对比的成本很低。<strong>在 Llama-3.1-8B 上，PCA 把选择题准确率从 50.55% 提高到 62.67%；在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上，LoReFT 把开放式问答准确率从 27.17% 提高到 33.41%。</strong>两类方法的取舍也看得出来：分析类方法能保持流畅度，学习类方法提高了准确率，代价是流畅度得分下降。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Using it today": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>上手使用",
 "EasySteer is Apache-2.0 licensed. The current release is built on vLLM 0.29.0 with continuous batching, prefix caching and CUDA-graph support, and its request API has evolved since the paper: a <code>SteeringSpec</code> replaces the paper's <code>SteerVectorRequest</code>, and token selection lives in <code>ApplySpec</code>. A minimal example:": "EasySteer 采用 Apache-2.0 许可证。当前版本基于 vLLM 0.29.0，支持连续批处理、前缀缓存和 CUDA Graph。论文发表后，请求 API 有所调整：<code>SteeringSpec</code> 取代了论文中的 <code>SteerVectorRequest</code>，token 选择放在 <code>ApplySpec</code> 里。最小示例如下：",
 "The same spec can be sent to an OpenAI-compatible server started with <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code>, as a <code>steering</code> field in each request. Single-vector steering now runs inside vLLM's CUDA graphs; on the repository's own v0.29 benchmark (RTX A6000, the same 1.5B model), all-layer steering costs about 3% of throughput. The repository also reproduces sixteen published steering papers as notebooks, from refusal directions and inference-time intervention to SEAL, SHARP for vision-language hallucination and SteerMoE for expert routing. Steering is dual-use: EasySteer is built as a research tool for safer, more controllable models, and any behavioural change made with it should be disclosed to users.": "同样的 spec 也可以发给用 <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code> 启动的 OpenAI 兼容服务，放在每个请求的 <code>steering</code> 字段里。单向量干预现在可以在 vLLM 的 CUDA Graph 内运行；在仓库自带的 v0.29 基准测试中（RTX A6000，同一个 1.5B 模型），全部层干预的吞吐量开销约 3%。仓库还以 notebook 形式复现了十六篇已发表的激活干预论文，从拒答方向、推理时干预，到 SEAL、针对视觉语言幻觉的 SHARP 和用于专家路由的 SteerMoE。激活干预具有两用性：EasySteer 是为构建更安全、更可控的模型而开发的研究工具，用它改变模型行为时，应当告知用户。",
 "A demonstration video is on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>; installation, the full API and the replications are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a>.": "演示视频见 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>；安装方法、完整 API 和复现代码见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">文档</a>。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path heads up and to the right, pauses at a node, and is nudged onto a new course across a torn paper fan": "动画：一条墨线向右上方延伸，在一个节点处停顿，随后被轻轻推向新的方向，穿过一把撕开的纸扇",
 "Step": "步骤",
 "Hidden states of cheerful and neutral texts, and the difference of their means": "欢快文本和中性文本的隐藏状态，以及两者均值之差",
 "Domain": "领域",
 "Sequence length": "序列长度",
 "Mode": "模式"
}